      "created": "2026-03-18T00:00:00Z",
      "modified": "2026-03-18T00:00:00Z",
      "name": "paws-operation-yarn-ball",
      "description": "PAWS (Pawsitive Vibes) Windows Active Directory capture with background lab activity across seven hosts and a short scripted intrusion prelude on PAWS-WS02. The evidenced sequence includes QEMU guest-agent PowerShell staging, Defender exclusion changes, OpenClaw-style host and domain discovery, attempted HTTP transfer commands, scheduled-task registration, staged-binary execution, and one outbound PowerShell connection to a lab host. The capture does not evidence the intended later stages of credential dumping, WinRM or PsExec lateral movement, bulk file encryption, or Windows event-log clearing. Contains 1,295,883 replayable events across Windows, Squid, and Zeek sources.",
      "scope": "incident",
      "start_refs": [
        "attack-action--ad58042f-8dae-5c2f-95b5-e30bb470ce47"
      ],
      "external_references": [
